adio DJ who is optimistic about love although a little naïve. After Chou Chen breaks up with his girlfriend, he runs into Hsiao-Shu at a ballpark. Can the unlikely pair, both unlucky in love, possibly find something in common that will reignite their faith in love? \"Love Around\" is a 2013 Taiwanese romantic drama series that reunites the popular stars George Hu and Annie Chen, who co-starred in the hit 2012 drama Love, Now (2012).","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8}],"value":8,"age":"PG-13"},"background_color":"","current_season_id":3528,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}